{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.46,
   "text": "VA, because you are a veteran and you serve the country,"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.78,
   "end": 6.76,
   "text": "you actually get to put down 0%, which is incredible."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.08,
   "end": 9.22,
   "text": "So you can get into a property with no money in,"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.4,
   "end": 10.96,
   "text": "and as long as you run the numbers and they work,"
  },
  {
   "start": 11.1,
   "end": 12.64,
   "text": "it's basically an infinite return"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.64,
   "end": 13.88,
   "text": "because you didn't have any money yet."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.04,
   "end": 15.74,
   "text": "The other piece is they allow you to have"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.74,
   "end": 18.5,
   "text": "up to 4% in seller credits, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.56,
   "end": 20.82,
   "text": "So it's not the 6% that you get with FHA,"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.12,
   "end": 22.8,
   "text": "but 4% is still pretty good."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.9,
   "end": 24.64,
   "text": "That should cover your closing costs."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.86,
   "end": 26.82,
   "text": "It may not allow you to buy down the interest rate much,"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.92,
   "end": 29.74,
   "text": "but your closing costs should be covered in that 4%."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.74,
   "end": 31.34,
   "text": "And again, you're bringing zero to the table."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.62,
   "end": 33.44,
   "text": "So typically when we help a VA client,"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.74,
   "end": 35.68,
   "text": "they're able to put down their earnest money"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.68,
   "end": 36.7,
   "text": "because you still need to do that."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.0,
   "end": 38.2,
   "text": "And then at the closing table,"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.56,
   "end": 40.66,
   "text": "they basically get a check for their earnest money back,"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.78,
   "end": 41.32,
   "text": "which is kind of cool."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.48,
   "end": 42.82,
   "text": "So it's like, okay, you put this down"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.82,
   "end": 44.22,
   "text": "to show that you were serious about the property"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.22,
   "end": 45.68,
   "text": "and now here goes your money back."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.9,
   "end": 48.14,
   "text": "And so you're getting paid to essentially buy the property,"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.44,
   "end": 48.98,
   "text": "which is pretty."
  }
 ],
